<title>SOUTH KOREA: Daehan City Gas in 1-for-4 bonus issue.</title>
<headline>Daehan City Gas in 1-for-4 bonus issue.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Daehan City Gas Co Ltd said on Wednesday it would offer a one-for-four bonus issue in December.</p>
<p>Daehan will issue 1.5 million common shares to be distributed to shareholders registered as of December 21 for the bonus issue, a company statement said.</p>
<p>Daehan shares closed at 62,500 won, up 1,000 won from Tuesday's closing.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5645</p>
